{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495670,"name":"","username":"warpdev","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/warpdev/{size}/46307_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T11:32:32.635Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot’s Computer Update/Reset is stuck. Settings shows “Backup not ready” and Update Grok Bot’s Computer cannot proceed. After Reset, UI stays on “Transferring your data” for over 1 hour with no detailed progress. Bot computer itself still responds (box-doctor PASS); this looks like a backend backup/transfer gate, not a local app-only issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover/rebuild the Agent Computer backup/transfer state on the backend for this account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot Settings → Updates → Update Grok Bot’s Computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve “Backup not ready” and Update blocked\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFreed ~39GB disk on the Agent Computer; status unchanged\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTried Reset Grok Bot’s Computer; stuck on “Transferring your data” 20+ minutes, then over 1 hour\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSampled box network during wait: ~0 MiB/s RX/TX (transfer not visible on the live box)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdate or Reset should complete, or backup should become ready so Update can run.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop. Agent Computer: box-doctor all PASS. OS of the desktop client not specified beyond timezone Asia/Seoul.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-actual-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-actual-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eActual\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Backup not ready” persists; Reset data transfer never finishes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-environment-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-environment-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eEnvironment\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProduct: Grok Bot desktop\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTimezone: Asia/Seoul\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWhen: 2026-09-19 evening KST\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAgent Computer healthy enough for chat/tools; box-doctor all PASS\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisk after cleanup: ~47% used / ~64GB free\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-already-tried-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-already-tried-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAlready tried\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisk cleanup (~39GB: Unity Hub/projects/caches), Update retry, Reset, long wait. In-app SendFeedback unavailable (privacy mode).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSometimes - I can sometimes use Cursor\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-19T11:32:43.567Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":10,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":50.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":172343,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":39822,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data/172343/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false}],"stream":[495670]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":373,"name":"computer-use","slug":"computer-use"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bot: Update/Reset stuck on “Backup not ready” / endless “Transferring